WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.025
A lighthouse flashed three times at midnight.

00:00:03.025 --> 00:00:05.312
But it's been switched off for forty years.

00:00:06.314 --> 00:00:07.301
Look closely.

00:00:07.301 --> 00:00:09.001
Someone left two clues.

00:00:10.022 --> 00:00:11.084
Pause the video.

00:00:11.084 --> 00:00:14.359
Ask your child: what are they, and what do they tell us?

00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:21.859
This is how Mr. Jay's students learn English: they read, find

00:00:21.859 --> 00:00:23.562
evidence, and explain why.

00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.770
The game takes about ten minutes, and there's no sign-up.

00:00:28.782 --> 00:00:30.532
Play the whole mystery free.

00:00:30.532 --> 00:00:33.282
Message Mr. Jay on Zalo: VIDEO.

